{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-05 16:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / DECEMBER 5, 2022 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ:SEDG) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 6, 2022 AND OCTOBER 19, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE \'\'CLASS PERIOD\'\'), ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM BEFORE JANUARY 3, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-05 11:35:00', 'title': 'SEDG SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ROSEN, TRUSTED INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - SEDG', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 5, 2022) - \xa0WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NASDAQ: SEDG) BETWEEN AUGUST 6, 2022 AND OCTOBER 19, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JANUARY 3, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-12-05 11:31:00', 'title': 'SEDG LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 5, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ("SOLAREDGE" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: SEDG) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOLAREDGE INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.'}{'symbol': 'SEDG',